      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَلَّبٌ</span></b> , applied to a garment, or piece of cloth,
(S, TA,) means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِيرُ الوَشْىِ</span>, (S, K, TA,) i. e.
[<i>Much variegated</i> or <i>figured;</i> or] <i>of many colours.</i> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِلْبٌ</span>.]

